     plug it into your device. It&#039;ll connect automatically, your=0A        =
                                            PC will download the right driv=
ers, and you can use it right=0A                                           =
         away.&lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A=0A=0A                                             =
   &lt;strong&gt;=0A                                                    2. To con=
nect a wireless printer, download the latest=0A                            =
                        driver and software package for your printer model =
from=0A                                                    the official web=
site and follow these steps:=0A                                            =
    &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A=0A                                                &lt;p&gt;a)=
 Select the Start button, then select Settings &gt;=0A                        =
                            Devices &gt; Printers &amp; scanners &gt; Add a printer o=
r=0A                                                    scanner.&lt;/p&gt;=0A    =
                                            &lt;p&gt;b) Wait for it to find nearb=
y printers, then choose the=0A                                             =
       one you want to use, and select Add device. If you want=0A          =
                                          to remove the printer later, just=
 highlight it and=0A                                                    sel=
ect Remove.&lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A=0A=0A=0A=0A                                          =
      &lt;h3 class=3D&quot;my-4&quot;&gt;Setup a New Printer (Mac)&lt;/h3&gt;=0A=0A              =
                                  &lt;strong&gt;=0A                              =
